<title>USA: TABLE - Norwest Corp unit sells debt.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Norwest Corp unit sells debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Norwest Financial Corp, a unit of Norwest Corp, was priced Friday, according to lead manager Chase Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER NORWEST FINANCIAL CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 6.00 PCT   MATURITY 8/1/1999</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
